# UI / Design System

Source: [design](../../docs/design.md). **Dark theme only** in v1.

## Visual language

- Calm dark SaaS (reference: ILovePDF / Convertio / Smallpdf).
- Single blue CTA accent: `#4C8DFF` (hover `#6BA0FF`, pressed `#3A78E8`).
- UI font: **Manrope**; code: **JetBrains Mono**.
- Screen hero = dropzone + “Конвертировать” CTA, not marketing or illustrations.

## Tokens (CSS variables / SCSS)

- Backgrounds: `neutral` `#0B0F14`, `surface` `#121820`, `surface-raised` `#1A222D`.
- Text: `on-surface` `#E8EDF5`, muted `#9AA3B5`.
- Status: success `#3DCF8E`, warning `#E6B84D`, error `#F07178`.
- Radii: sm 6 / md 10 / lg 14; buttons and inputs — height **44px**.

## UX rules

- One file per operation; explicit job statuses: queued → processing → done / error.
- UI errors and hints — **in Russian**.
- No glow, purple gradients, light theme, or extra cards/stat blocks on the home screen.
- Responsive: desktop + mobile; focus ring = primary.
